    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "5 Consultants and contractors etc.",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-border-force-act-2015#sec-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-border-force-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-border-force-act-2015.pdf, p.14",
      "values:originalText": "Consultants and contractors\n\n(1) The Secretary or the Australian Border Force Commissioner may,\nby written determination, specify a person for the purposes of\nsubparagraph (e)(ii) of the definition of Immigration and Border\nProtection worker in subsection 4(1).\nOther persons\n\n(2) The Secretary or the Australian Border Force Commissioner may,\nby written determination, specify a person for the purposes of\n\n\nPreliminary  Part 1\n\nSection 6\n\nAustralian Border Force Act 2015\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nsubparagraph (f)(iii) of the definition of Immigration and Border\nProtection worker in subsection 4(1).\nDeterminations are not legislative instruments\n\n(3) A determination under this section is not a legislative instrument.",
      "skos:definition": "Consultants and contractors\n\n(1) The Secretary or the Australian Border Force Commissioner may,\nby written determination, specify a person for the purposes of\nsubparagraph (e)(ii) of the definition of Immigration and Border\nProtection worker in subsection 4(1).\nOther persons\n\n(2) The Secretary or the Australian Border Force Commissioner may,\nby written determination, specify a person for the purposes of\n\n\nPreliminary  Part 1\n\nSection 6\n\nAustralian Border Force Act 2015\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nsubparagraph (f)(iii) of the definition of Immigration and Border\nProtection worker in subsection 4(1).\nDeterminations are not legislative instruments\n\n(3) A determination under this section is not a legislative instrument.",
