      },
      "dc:source": "australian-border-force-act-2015.pdf, p.17",
      "values:originalText": "The Australian Border Force Commissioner has power to do all\nthings necessary or convenient to be done for or in connection with\nthe performance of his or her duties.",
      "skos:definition": "The Australian Border Force Commissioner has power to do all\nthings necessary or convenient to be done for or in connection with\nthe performance of his or her duties.",
