      "cml:premiseText": "(1) The Australian Border Force Commissioner is to be appointed by the Governor-General by written instrument.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "THE APPOINTMENT OF THE AUSTRALIAN BORDER FORCE COMMISSIONER OCCURS BETWEEN THE TIME THE GOVERNOR-GENERAL WRITES THE INSTRUMENT AND THE TIME IT IS SIGNED."
    },
    {
