    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-13",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "13 Oath or affirmation by Australian Border Force Commissioner",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-border-force-act-2015#sec-13"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-border-force-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-border-force-act-2015.pdf, p.18",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Australian Border Force Commissioner must, before\nbeginning to discharge the duties of his or her office, make and\nsubscribe an oath or affirmation in accordance with the form\nprescribed by the rules for the purposes of this subsection.\n\n(2) The Australian Border Force Commissioner must make and\nsubscribe the oath or affirmation before the Minister.\n\n\nAustralian Border Force Commissioner  Part 2\nAppointment of the Australian Border Force Commissioner  Division 3\n\nSection 14\n\nAustralian Border Force Act 2015\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nCompliance\n\n(3) The Australian Border Force Commissioner must not engage in\nconduct that is inconsistent with an oath or affirmation he or she\nhas made and subscribed under this section.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Australian Border Force Commissioner must, before\nbeginning to discharge the duties of his or her office, make and\nsubscribe an oath or affirmation in accordance with the form\nprescribed by the rules for the purposes of this subsection.\n\n(2) The Australian Border Force Commissioner must make and\nsubscribe the oath or affirmation before the Minister.\n\n\nAustralian Border Force Commissioner  Part 2\nAppointment of the Australian Border Force Commissioner  Division 3\n\nSection 14\n\nAustralian Border Force Act 2015\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nCompliance\n\n(3) The Australian Border Force Commissioner must not engage in\nconduct that is inconsistent with an oath or affirmation he or she\nhas made and subscribed under this section.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-13-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-13-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-13-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d9c2174f08c9db365f916e3f45cda26f588cbae07f45d91bc8ea0cb91ad84d75"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-border-force-act-2015#sec-13",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "13 Oath or affirmation by Australian Border Force Commissioner",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 18,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Australian Border Force Commissioner must, before\nbeginning to discharge the duties of his or her office, make and\nsubscribe an oath or affirmation in accordance with the form\nprescribed by the rules for the purposes of this subsection.\n\n(2) The Australian Border Force Commissioner must make and\nsubscribe the oath or affirmation before the Minister.\n\n\nAustralian Border Force Commissioner  Part 2\nAppointment of the Australian Border Force Commissioner  Division 3\n\nSection 14\n\nAustralian Border Force Act 2015\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nCompliance\n\n(3) The Australian Border Force Commissioner must not engage in\nconduct that is inconsistent with an oath or affirmation he or she\nhas made and subscribed under this section."
    },
