      },
      "dc:source": "australian-border-force-act-2015.pdf, p.19",
      "values:originalText": "For the purposes of the finance law (within the meaning of the\nPublic Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013),\nthe Australian Border Force Commissioner (including in his or her\ncapacity as the Comptroller-General of Customs) is an official of\nthe Department.",
      "skos:definition": "For the purposes of the finance law (within the meaning of the\nPublic Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013),\nthe Australian Border Force Commissioner (including in his or her\ncapacity as the Comptroller-General of Customs) is an official of\nthe Department.",
