        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-18-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Cannot",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibition of engaging in paid work outside office duties.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Minister's approval required.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Australian Border Force Commissioner must not engage in paid work outside office duties."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-19",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "19 Disclosure of interests",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-border-force-act-2015#sec-19"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-border-force-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-border-force-act-2015.pdf, p.20",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Australian Border Force Commissioner must give written\nnotice to the Minister of any direct or indirect pecuniary interest\n\n\nAustralian Border Force Commissioner  Part 2\nTerms and conditions for the Australian Border Force Commissioner  Division 4\n\nSection 20\n\nAustralian Border Force Act 2015\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nthat the Commissioner has or acquires and that conflicts or could\nconflict with the proper performance of the Commissioner’s\nfunctions.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) applies in addition to section 29 of the Public\nGovernance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013 (which\ndeals with the duty to disclose interests).",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Australian Border Force Commissioner must give written\nnotice to the Minister of any direct or indirect pecuniary interest\n\n\nAustralian Border Force Commissioner  Part 2\nTerms and conditions for the Australian Border Force Commissioner  Division 4\n\nSection 20\n\nAustralian Border Force Act 2015\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nthat the Commissioner has or acquires and that conflicts or could\nconflict with the proper performance of the Commissioner’s\nfunctions.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) applies in addition to section 29 of the Public\nGovernance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013 (which\ndeals with the duty to disclose interests).",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-19-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-19-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3da6fbe9e30e11a9de8dac0eed4cab1e5f591d2b5e22a111b87f2e7293ccefd7"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-border-force-act-2015#sec-19",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "19 Disclosure of interests",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 20,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Australian Border Force Commissioner must give written\nnotice to the Minister of any direct or indirect pecuniary interest\n\n\nAustralian Border Force Commissioner  Part 2\nTerms and conditions for the Australian Border Force Commissioner  Division 4\n\nSection 20\n\nAustralian Border Force Act 2015\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nthat the Commissioner has or acquires and that conflicts or could\nconflict with the proper performance of the Commissioner’s\nfunctions.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) applies in addition to section 29 of the Public\nGovernance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013 (which\ndeals with the duty to disclose interests)."
    },
