      "values:originalText": "(2) A person must make and subscribe the oath or affirmation before\nthe Australian Border Force Commissioner or a person authorised\nby the Commissioner.\nCompliance",
      "skos:definition": "(2) A person must make and subscribe the oath or affirmation before\nthe Australian Border Force Commissioner or a person authorised\nby the Commissioner.\nCompliance",
