    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-26-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "26(4) Directions—administration and control of the operations of the",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-border-force-act-2015#sec-26-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-border-force-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-border-force-act-2015.pdf, p.26",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Without limiting subsection (1), directions under that subsection\nmay relate to the reporting by persons mentioned in\nparagraph (1)(a) or (b) of the following:\n\n(a) serious misconduct by such a person;\n\n(b) criminal activity involving such a person;\nwhere the serious misconduct or criminal activity affects, or is\nlikely to affect, the operations, responsibilities or reputation of the\nDepartment.\nCompliance with directions",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Without limiting subsection (1), directions under that subsection\nmay relate to the reporting by persons mentioned in\nparagraph (1)(a) or (b) of the following:\n\n(a) serious misconduct by such a person;\n\n(b) criminal activity involving such a person;\nwhere the serious misconduct or criminal activity affects, or is\nlikely to affect, the operations, responsibilities or reputation of the\nDepartment.\nCompliance with directions",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-26"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-26-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-26-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "297ab1e9dd1c23e9fc5436652b9a6848e3cfb315ddc4c5e201f0ff5e3caf34e7",
      "skos:note": "Compliance with directions regarding serious misconduct or criminal activity"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-border-force-act-2015#sec-26-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26(4) Directions—administration and control of the operations of the",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 26,
      "values:originalText": "(4) Without limiting subsection (1), directions under that subsection\nmay relate to the reporting by persons mentioned in\nparagraph (1)(a) or (b) of the following:\n\n(a) serious misconduct by such a person;\n\n(b) criminal activity involving such a person;\nwhere the serious misconduct or criminal activity affects, or is\nlikely to affect, the operations, responsibilities or reputation of the\nDepartment.\nCompliance with directions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-26-ss-4-norm",
