      "cof:title": "34(3) Alcohol screening test—suspicion that Immigration and Border",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 36,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If the result of the alcohol screening test shows that alcohol is not\npresent in the worker’s breath, he or she may return to his or her\nduties immediately.\n\n\nAlcohol and drug tests  Part 5\n\nSection 35\n\nAustralian Border Force Act 2015\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nRelationship with section 35"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-34-ss-3-norm",
