      "dc:source": "australian-border-force-act-2015.pdf, p.40",
      "values:originalText": "(2) A sample of blood for the purpose of an alcohol blood test under\nsection 35 or 36, or a body sample for the purpose of a prohibited\n\n\nAlcohol and drug tests  Part 5\n\nSection 39\n\nAustralian Border Force Act 2015\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\ndrug test under that section, is to be provided in accordance with\nthe rules.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) A sample of blood for the purpose of an alcohol blood test under\nsection 35 or 36, or a body sample for the purpose of a prohibited\n\n\nAlcohol and drug tests  Part 5\n\nSection 39\n\nAustralian Border Force Act 2015\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\ndrug test under that section, is to be provided in accordance with\nthe rules.",
