          "@id": "concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-43-logic-deontic-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-43-logic-deontic-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c9ccdd638b40374bfbf1af90c596f738f6a0d3a94ea7f8881c7a8900e0e668cc",
      "skos:note": "Disclosure of Immigration and Border Protection information for specified purposes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-border-force-act-2015#sec-43",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "43 Records or disclosure for the purposes of this Act or integrity",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 44,
      "values:originalText": "bodies\n\nAn entrusted person may make a record of, or disclose,\nImmigration and Border Protection information if:\n\n(a) the making of the record, or disclosure, is for the purposes of\nthis Act or a legislative instrument under this Act; or\n\n(b) the making of the record, or disclosure, is for the purposes of\nthe National Anti-Corruption Commission Act 2022 or\nregulations under that Act; or\n\n(c) the making of the record, or disclosure, is for the purposes of\nan IGIS official exercising a power, or performing a function\nor duty, as an IGIS official.\n\n\nSecrecy and disclosure provisions  Part 6\n\nSection 44\n\nAustralian Border Force Act 2015\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026"
    },
