      "values:originalText": "(1) The Secretary may, by writing, delegate any of his or her functions\nor powers under a law of the Commonwealth to:\n\n(a) the Australian Border Force Commissioner; or\n\n(b) an Immigration and Border Protection worker.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Secretary may, by writing, delegate any of his or her functions\nor powers under a law of the Commonwealth to:\n\n(a) the Australian Border Force Commissioner; or\n\n(b) an Immigration and Border Protection worker.",
      "values:partOf": {
