      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-border-force-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-border-force-act-2015.pdf, p.53",
      "values:originalText": "(2) However, subsection (1) does not apply in relation to:\n\n(a) section 30 (resignation in anticipation of termination of\nemployment); or\n\n(b) section 32 (termination of employment for serious\nmisconduct); or\n\n(c) the Migration Act 1958 or an instrument under that Act.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) However, subsection (1) does not apply in relation to:\n\n(a) section 30 (resignation in anticipation of termination of\nemployment); or\n\n(b) section 32 (termination of employment for serious\nmisconduct); or\n\n(c) the Migration Act 1958 or an instrument under that Act.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-53"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-53-ss-2-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7d004f16ef59e4b46c7450ce852b527c09ad05610c7e686cc86ee160262b0e12",
      "skos:note": "Exemptions from subsection (1)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-border-force-act-2015#sec-53-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "53(2) Delegation by Secretary",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 53,
      "values:originalText": "(2) However, subsection (1) does not apply in relation to:\n\n(a) section 30 (resignation in anticipation of termination of\nemployment); or\n\n(b) section 32 (termination of employment for serious\nmisconduct); or\n\n(c) the Migration Act 1958 or an instrument under that Act."
    },
