      },
      "dc:source": "australian-border-force-act-2015.pdf, p.56",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Without limiting subsection (2), essential qualifications may have\none or more of the following components:\n\n(a) physical or psychological health or fitness;\n\n(b) professional or technical qualifications;\n\n(c) learning and development requirements;\n\n(d) security clearances.\nOrganisational suitability assessments",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Without limiting subsection (2), essential qualifications may have\none or more of the following components:\n\n(a) physical or psychological health or fitness;\n\n(b) professional or technical qualifications;\n\n(c) learning and development requirements;\n\n(d) security clearances.\nOrganisational suitability assessments",
