    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-55-ss-10",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "55(10) Directions by Secretary—administration and control of the",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-border-force-act-2015#sec-55-ss-10"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-border-force-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-border-force-act-2015.pdf, p.56",
      "values:originalText": "(10) If an Immigration and Border Protection worker is required by a\ndirection of the kind mentioned in subsection (5) to give\ninformation, answer a question or produce a document, the worker\nis not excused from:\n\n(a) giving the information; or\n\n(b) answering the question; or",
      "skos:definition": "(10) If an Immigration and Border Protection worker is required by a\ndirection of the kind mentioned in subsection (5) to give\ninformation, answer a question or produce a document, the worker\nis not excused from:\n\n(a) giving the information; or\n\n(b) answering the question; or",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-55"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
